c.io/ev-mercury/Z6oy35bqstJ9-cW3_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10785.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6oy35bqstJ9-cW3_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10785.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="An older couple, a man and a woman, are sat on a sofa. The woman is showing the man something on the screen." width="1000" height="667" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>1. Find your retailer</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We return parcels to hundreds of retailers. Choose from the most popular shops or enter their name in the search box. <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><a href="/faqs/returning-a-parcel/i-cant-find-my-retailers-name-on-the-list" rel="noreferrer"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->If you can’t find your retailer, check our FAQ page<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" data-test-id="modal-card" aria-label="Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d4c8c135 data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__content" data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__header" data-v-a7583600><!----></div><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-m e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05 e-modal__avatar" style="" data-test-id="modal-avatar" aria-hidden="true" data-v-a7583600 data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="success" data-test-id="avatar-icon" data-v-4b59c4a2 data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="32" width="32" style="line-height:32px" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Success</title> <path opacity="0.2" d="M7.3 25.76C-0.35 18.92 3.31 7.11 9.69 4C4.74 22.65 20.04 26.54 28 21.87C26.41 27.31 14.94 32.6 7.3 25.76Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path d="M24.76 11.75L13.6 22.91L7.24 16.55L8.35 15.44L13.6 20.69L23.65 10.64L24.76 11.75Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16 1.71C23.88 1.71 30.29 8.12 30.29 16C30.29 23.88 23.88 30.29 16 30.29C8.12 30.29 1.71 23.88 1.71 16C1.71 8.12 8.12 1.71 16 1.71ZM16 3.27C8.98 3.27 3.27 8.98 3.27 16C3.27 23.02 8.98 28.73 16 28.73C23.02 28.73 28.73 23.02 28.73 16C28.73 8.98 23.02 3.27 16 3.27Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </svg></div><!----></div><h2 class="e-modal__heading" data-test-id="heading" data-v-a7583600>Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready</h2><!----><div class="e-modal__slot-wrapper" data-test-id="slot-wrapper" data-v-a7583600><!--[--><div class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__content" data-v-d4c8c135><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> We need to log you out to update your pricing. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> Simply log back in and start booking parcels to see your new discounts automatically applied. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__countdown" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" data-v-d4c8c135> Logging you out in 10 seconds... </p></div><!--]--></div><!----></div></dialog><!--]--></div></section><section id="2.-choose-your-return-method" class="section-wrapper article-link-module article-link-module--neutral conditional-section-wrapper" data-slice-type="article_link_module" data-slice-variation="3Column" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!--[--><h2><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->2. Choose your return method<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h2><!--]--><div class="article-link-module__section-description" data-v-10a41d36><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->All we need is your order reference number, email address, reason for returning the parcel and, for some retailers, what it is you’ll be returning. Take your pick from:<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><div class="article-link-module__cards-container" data-v-10a41d36><!--[--><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJJZbqstJ9-Tfw_EVRI_LOCATION_03_28478a65.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJJZbqstJ9-Tfw_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2847.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJJZbqstJ9-Tfw_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2847.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJJZbqstJ9-Tfw_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2847.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Customer stood outside of a ParcelShop store smiling and holding a parcel. The blue Evri signage can be seen on the storefront." width="1000" height="667" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><!----><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->ParcelShop drop off<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><!--]--><div class="article-link-item__description" data-v-6b4a6e25><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We have more than 9,000+ ParcelShops across the UK, all conveniently located in local stores. Print your label at home or with a Print ParcelShop device, available at most ParcelShops. If your return is free, you don’t even need to book online – just use the device from start to finish.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="article-link-item__cta" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__buttons" data-v-6b4a6e25><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--link article-link-item__primary" data-gtm-track="button-Find a ParcelShop-open Find a ParcelShop page" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/find-a-parcelshop" data-v-6b4a6e25 style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->Find a ParcelShop<!--]--></span></a><!----></div><!----></div></div></article><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6THgpbqstJ9-Tdi_EVRI_LOCATION_03_30588a65.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6THgpbqstJ9-Tdi_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3058.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6THgpbqstJ9-Tdi_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3058.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6THgpbqstJ9-Tdi_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3058.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Customer standing outside with a blue Evri Locker in the background. They are holding a parcel and smiling for the photo." width="1000" height="667" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><!----><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Locker drop off<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><!--]--><div class="article-link-item__description" data-v-6b4a6e25><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Take your pick from our 24/7 Locker locations across the UK. You’ll need to print the returns label at home<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="article-link-item__cta" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__buttons" data-v-6b4a6e25><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--link article-link-item__primary" data-gtm-track="button-Find a Locker-open Find a Locker page" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/find-a-parcelshopa177?lockers=true" data-v-6b4a6e25 style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->Find a Locker<!--]--></span></a><!----></div><!----></div></div></article><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6pDmZbqstJ9-cfc_EVRI_LOCATION_04_42158a65.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6pDmZbqstJ9-cfc_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4215.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6pDmZbqstJ9-cfc_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4215.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6pDmZbqstJ9-cfc_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4215.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Following a doorstep collection in a block of flats, an Evri Courier is handing the customer a blue slip containing the details of the collection." width="1000" height="667" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><!----><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Courier collection<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><!--]--><div class="article-link-item__description" data-v-6b4a6e25><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Book a parcel collection from your home or work. You’ll need to print the label.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="article-link-item__cta" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__buttons" data-v-6b4a6e25><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--link article-link-item__primary" data-gtm-track="button-Return a parcel-open Return a parcel page" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/return-a-parcel" data-v-6b4a6e25 style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->Return a parcel<!--]--></span></a><!----></div><!----></div></div></article><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section><section id="3.-drop-off-your-parcel-or-let-your-courier-collect-it" class="section-wrapper" index="4" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><!----><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><div class="card__image" data-v-e1e30b9c><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJDpbqstJ9-Tfl_EVRI_LOCATION_03_266852b8.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJDpbqstJ9-Tfl_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2668.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=47%2C0%2C5906%2C3939&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJDpbqstJ9-Tfl_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2668.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=47%2C0%2C5906%2C3939&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJDpbqstJ9-Tfl_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2668.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=47%2C0%2C5906%2C3939&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="ParcelShop store assistant is smiling and using a blue hand-held device to scan a parcel. The customer can be seen in the foreground." width="1000" height="667" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>3. Drop off your parcel or let your courier collect it</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->If you choose to return your parcel using a <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><a href="/parcelshops" rel="noreferrer"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->ParcelShop<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->, you can either print the Evri returns label at home or in a <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><a href="/parcelshops/print-in-parcelshop" rel="noreferrer"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->ParcelShop with Print In ParcelShop<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> device using a QR or authorisation code (we’ll email it to you).<!--]--><!--[--><br>For our <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><a href="/parcelshops/lockers" rel="noreferrer"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Lockers – open 24/7<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> – just print and attach the label, then drop off your parcel whenever it suits you.<!--]--><!--[--><br>If you’ve arranged a courier collection, we’ll let you know when we’ll be collecting it.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--icon e-button--link card__button" data-gtm-track="button-Return a parcel" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/return-a-parcel" data-v-e1e30b9c style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><div class="e-button__icon" data-v-a7b41470><!--[--><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_right" data-test-id="chevron_right" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron right</title> <g> <path d="M12.6 12L8.7 8.1C8.52 7.92 8.42 7.68 8.42 7.4C8.42 7.12 8.52 6.88 8.7 6.7C8.88 6.52 9.12 6.42 9.4 6.42C9.68 6.42 9.92 6.52 10.1 6.7L14.7 11.3C14.8 11.4 14.87 11.51 14.91 11.62C14.95 11.74 14.97 11.87 14.97 12C14.97 12.13 14.95 12.26 14.91 12.38C14.87 12.49 14.8 12.6 14.7 12.7L10.1 17.3C9.92 17.48 9.68 17.57 9.4 17.57C9.12 17.57 8.88 17.48 8.7 17.3C8.52 17.12 8.42 16.88 8.42 16.6C8.42 16.32 8.52 16.08 8.7 15.9L12.6 12Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div><!--]--></div><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[--> Return a parcel<!--]--></span></a><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" data-test-id="modal-card" aria-label="Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d4c8c135 data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__content" data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__header" data-v-a7583600><!----></div><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-m e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05 e-modal__avatar" style="" data-test-id="modal-avatar" aria-hidden="true" data-v-a7583600 data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="success" data-test-id="avatar-icon" data-v-4b59c4a2 data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="32" width="32" style="line-height:32px" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Success</title> <path opacity="0.2" d="M7.3 25.76C-0.35 18.92 3.31 7.11 9.69 4C4.74 22.65 20.04 26.54 28 21.87C26.41 27.31 14.94 32.6 7.3 25.76Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path d="M24.76 11.75L13.6 22.91L7.24 16.55L8.35 15.44L13.6 20.69L23.65 10.64L24.76 11.75Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16 1.71C23.88 1.71 30.29 8.12 30.29 16C30.29 23.88 23.88 30.29 16 30.29C8.12 30.29 1.71 23.88 1.71 16C1.71 8.12 8.12 1.71 16 1.71ZM16 3.27C8.98 3.27 3.27 8.98 3.27 16C3.27 23.02 8.98 28.73 16 28.73C23.02 28.73 28.73 23.02 28.73 16C28.73 8.98 23.02 3.27 16 3.27Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </svg></div><!----></div><h2 class="e-modal__heading" data-test-id="heading" data-v-a7583600>Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready</h2><!----><div class="e-modal__slot-wrapper" data-test-id="slot-wrapper" data-v-a7583600><!--[--><div class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__content" data-v-d4c8c135><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> We need to log you out to update your pricing. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> Simply log back in and start booking parcels to see your new discounts automatically applied. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__countdown" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" data-v-d4c8c135> Logging you out in 10 seconds... </p></div><!--]--></div><!----></div></dialog><!--]--></div></section><section id="return-your-parcel-using-a-print-in-parcelshop-device" data-slice="FeatureBanner" class="feature-banner feature-banner--pt-0 feature-banner--pb-0" index="5" data-v-054940bd><div class="feature-banner__container" data-v-054940bd><div class="feature-banner__content" data-v-054940bd><!----><h2 class="feature-banner__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-054940bd>Return your parcel using a Print In ParcelShop device</h2><div class="feature-banner__text" data-v-054940bd><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->If your return is free, you can take your item to any ParcelShop with a Print In ParcelShop device without booking online first.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Simply select your retailer, enter your return information, print your label and hand the parcel to a member of store staff.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->If you need to pay for your return, just fill in your details online first and use the QR or authorisation code we’ll email to you at the Print In ParcelShop device to print off your label.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-3 e-button--icon-right e-button--link feature-banner__button" data-gtm-track="button-More information" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/parcelshops/print-in-parcelshop" data-v-054940bd style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->More information<!--]--></span></a></div><div class="feature-banner__image" data-v-054940bd><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJbpbqstJ9-TgK_EVRI_LOCATION_PIS2ef8f.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJbpbqstJ9-TgK_EVRI_LOCATION_PIS2.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C0%2C6706%2C4473&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJbpbqstJ9-TgK_EVRI_LOCATION_PIS2.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C0%2C6706%2C4473&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJbpbqstJ9-TgK_EVRI_LOCATION_PIS2.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C0%2C6706%2C4473&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="A close-up of a customer applying a label to their parcel. A ParcelShop Print in Store device is in view behind the parcel." width="1000" height="667" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-054940bd></div><!----></div></section><section id="article_link_module" class="section-wrapper article-link-module article-link-module--neutral conditional-section-wrapper" data-slice-type="article_link_module" data-slice-variation="default-slice" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!--v-if--><div class="article-link-module__section-description" data-v-10a41d36><!--v-if--></div><div class="article-link-module__cards-container--2cols article-link-module__cards-container" data-v-10a41d36><!--[--><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJWZbqstJ9-Tf__EVRI_LOCATION_03_31119ddd.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJWZbqstJ9-Tf__EVRI_LOCATION_03_3111.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=470%2C0%2C5460%2C3642&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJWZbqstJ9-Tf__EVRI_LOCATION_03_3111.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=470%2C0%2C5460%2C3642&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJWZbqstJ9-Tf__EVRI_LOCATION_03_3111.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=470%2C0%2C5460%2C3642&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="An Evri ParcelShop is in full view with its blue signage and a customer is walking up the accesssbility ramp and holding a parcel." width="1000" height="667" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><!----><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Find your local ParcelShop or Locker<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><!--]--><div class="article-link-item__description" data-v-6b4a6e25><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Enter your postcode to find your nearest ParcelShop or Locker<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="article-link-item__cta" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__buttons" data-v-6b4a6e25><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--link article-link-item__primary" data-gtm-track="button-Find a ParcelShop or Locker-open Find a ParcelShop or Locker page" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/find-a-parcelshop" data-v-6b4a6e25 style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->Find a ParcelShop or Locker<!--]--></span></a><!----></div><!----></div></div></article><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6XtIZbqstJ9-Wfd_EVRI_LOCATION_04_56338a65.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6XtIZbqstJ9-Wfd_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5633.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6XtIZbqstJ9-Wfd_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5633.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6XtIZbqstJ9-Wfd_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5633.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="A close-up of a customer sitting on a sofa, holding their phone and looking at the screen. The display shows the &#39;Track&#39; page for the customer to track where their parcel is on its journey." width="1000" height="667" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><!----><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Track your return parcel<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><!--]--><div class="article-link-item__description" data-v-6b4a6e25><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Track your parcel throughout its journey<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="article-link-item__cta" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__buttons" data-v-6b4a6e25><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--link article-link-item__primary" data-gtm-track="button-Track your parcel-open Track your parcel page" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/track-a-parcel" data-v-6b4a6e25 style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->Track your parcel<!--]--></span></a><!----></div><!----></div></div></article><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section><div id="faqs" class="accordion accordion--brand-03" index="7" data-v-68f9b820><div class="accordion__main" data-v-68f9b820><h4 class="accordion__title" data-v-68f9b820>FAQs</h4><!----><div no-padding class="accordion__container" data-v-68f9b820><!--[--><div class="e-accordion-row accordion__row" data-test-id="icantfindmyretailersnameonthelistwhatshouldido-accordion" data-v-68f9b820 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-icantfindmyretailersnameonthelistwhatshouldido" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-icantfindmyretailersnameonthelistwhatshouldido" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-test-id="icantfindmyretailersnameonthelistwhatshouldido-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="icantfindmyretailersnameonthelistwhatshouldido-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>I can&#39;t find my retailers name on the list, what should I do?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-icantfindmyretailersnameonthelistwhatshouldido" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-icantfindmyretailersnameonthelistwhatshouldido" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="icantfindmyretailersnameonthelistwhatshouldido-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Unfortunately, we don’t offer a returns service for all retailers, so if your retailer’s name isn’t showing they might not use Evri for their returns. If you can’t find your retailer, we’d recommend contacting them to find out if they use Evri for their returns, as well as what name you’ll find them under.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row accordion__row" data-test-id="canisendaparcelbacktoaretaileryoudontreturnfor-accordion" data-v-68f9b820 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-canisendaparcelbacktoaretaileryoudontreturnfor" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-canisendaparcelbacktoaretaileryoudontreturnfor" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-test-id="canisendaparcelbacktoaretaileryoudontreturnfor-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="canisendaparcelbacktoaretaileryoudontreturnfor-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>Can I send a parcel back to a retailer you don&#39;t return for?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-canisendaparcelbacktoaretaileryoudontreturnfor" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-canisendaparcelbacktoaretaileryoudontreturnfor" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="canisendaparcelbacktoaretaileryoudontreturnfor-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->If your retailer’s name isn’t on our list and we don’t return for them, please contact them directly to see what returns methods they use. We&#39;d also recommend checking inside the package, as some retailers leave an insert with details on returning the item to them.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row accordion__row" data-test-id="canireturnanitemwithevri-accordion" data-v-68f9b820 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-canireturnanitemwithevri" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-canireturnanitemwithevri" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-test-id="canireturnanitemwithevri-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="canireturnanitemwithevri-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>Can I return an item with Evri?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-canireturnanitemwithevri" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-canireturnanitemwithevri" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="canireturnanitemwithevri-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Yes, provided the retailer or seller uses Evri for their returns. First, check to see how the retailer or seller would like you to return your item. This could be a pre-printed label that came with your parcel, or your retailer might book it with us for you. Or, you can use our app or website to return it yourself.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row accordion__row" data-test-id="howlongwillmyreturntaketogetbacktotheretailer-accordion" data-v-68f9b820 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-howlongwillmyreturntaketogetbacktotheretailer" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-howlongwillmyreturntaketogetbacktotheretailer" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-test-id="howlongwillmyreturntaketogetbacktotheretailer-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="howlongwillmyreturntaketogetbacktotheretailer-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>How long will my return take to get back to the retailer?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-howlongwillmyreturntaketogetbacktotheretailer" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-howlongwillmyreturntaketogetbacktotheretailer" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="howlongwillmyreturntaketogetbacktotheretailer-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Please allow 14 days from the time you returned your item. It can sometimes take a while for the retailer or seller to confirm they’ve received your parcel.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row accordion__row" data-test-id="whatifmyreturnhasntbeenreceived-accordion" data-v-68f9b820 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-whatifmyreturnhasntbeenreceived" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-whatifmyreturnhasntbeenreceived" aria-expanded="false" class="e-ac