-4940-9e68-c3ee5393f31d","\u002Freturn-a-parcel",{"link_type":43},"Any",{"dimensions":45,"alt":48,"copyright":30,"url":49,"id":50,"edit":51},{"width":46,"height":47},300,53,"Return","how-to-return-a-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fe99472f1-ee70-40a3-bf52-43f58e5a6da9_return.svg","YhYpMRIAAC0A0QB6",{"x":52,"y":52,"zoom":53,"background":54},0,1,"#fff",{},{"link_type":19},"page_header$66e95f69-77b1-4481-a685-a1d77fffc355","page_header",{"variation":60,"version":26,"items":61,"primary":63,"id":71,"slice_type":72,"slice_label":30},"cardNoImageWithCta",[62],{},{"CardAvatar":64,"CardTitle":65,"CardText":66,"ButtonText":30,"ButtonUrl":70,"IsEco":21},"none","How to return a parcel",[67],{"type":34,"text":68,"spans":69},"Return a parcel with Evri in 3 EASY steps. It all starts with one click or tap of a button.",[],{"link_type":43},"card$fa712bc9-4f23-4ff3-a568-eae7a5f47a86","card",{"variation":25,"version":26,"items":74,"primary":76,"id":100,"slice_type":72,"slice_label":30},[75],{},{"CardImage":77,"CardAvatar":64,"CardTitle":86,"CardText":87,"ButtonText":30,"ButtonUrl":99,"IsEco":21},{"dimensions":78,"alt":81,"copyright":30,"url":82,"id":83,"edit":84},{"width":79,"height":80},1000,667,"An older couple, a man and a woman, are sat on a sofa. The woman is showing the man something on the screen.","how-to-return-a-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6oy35bqstJ9-cW3_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10785.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6oy35bqstJ9-cW3",{"x":52,"y":52,"zoom":53,"background":85},"transparent","1. Find your retailer",[88],{"type":34,"text":89,"spans":90},"We return parcels to hundreds of retailers. Choose from the most popular shops or enter their name in the search box. If you can’t find your retailer, check our FAQ page.",[91,95],{"start":92,"end":93,"type":94},118,169,"strong",{"start":92,"end":93,"type":96,"data":97},"hyperlink",{"link_type":39,"url":98},"how-to-return-a-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ffaqs\u002Freturning-a-parcel\u002Fi-cant-find-my-retailers-name-on-the-list",{"link_type":43},"card$3159f961-0b14-46ac-80e5-ee75cd76ce86",{"variation":102,"version":26,"items":103,"primary":164,"id":174,"slice_type":175,"slice_label":30},"3Column",[104,126,146],{"Title":105,"Description":110,"Image":115,"Label":30,"UrlText":121,"Url":122,"buttonDataGtmTrack":30,"SecondaryButtonText":30,"SecondaryButtonUrl":125,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":30,"ShowAppDownloadCta":30},[106],{"type":107,"text":108,"spans":109},"heading3","ParcelShop drop off",[],[111],{"type":34,"text":112,"spans":113,"direction":114},"We have more than 9,000+ ParcelShops across the UK, all conveniently located in local stores. Print your label at home or with a Print ParcelShop device, available at most ParcelShops. If your return is free, you don’t even need to book online – just use the device from start to finish.",[],"ltr",{"dimensions":116,"alt":117,"copyright":30,"url":118,"id":119,"edit":120},{"width":79,"height":80},"Customer stood outside of a ParcelShop store smiling and holding a parcel. The blue Evri signage can be seen on the storefront.","how-to-return-a-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJJZbqstJ9-Tfw_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2847.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6TJJZbqstJ9-Tfw",{"x":52,"y":52,"zoom":53,"background":85},"Find a ParcelShop",{"link_type":39,"key":123,"url":124},"f7f6c05c-f293-4813-a75c-ab5ed009cf10","\u002Ffind-a-parcelshop",{"link_type":43},{"Title":127,"Description":131,"Image":135,"Label":30,"UrlText":141,"Url":142,"buttonDataGtmTrack":30,"SecondaryButtonText":30,"SecondaryButtonUrl":145,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":30,"ShowAppDownloadCta":30},[128],{"type":107,"text":129,"spans":130},"Locker drop off",[],[132],{"type":34,"text":133,"spans":134,"direction":114},"Take your pick from our 24\u002F7 Locker locations across the UK. You’ll need to print the returns label at home",[],{"dimensions":136,"alt":137,"copyright":30,"url":138,"id":139,"edit":140},{"width":79,"height":80},"Customer standing outside with a blue Evri Locker in the background. They are holding a parcel and smiling for the photo.","how-to-return-a-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6THgpbqstJ9-Tdi_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3058.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6THgpbqstJ9-Tdi",{"x":52,"y":52,"zoom":53,"background":85},"Find a Locker",{"link_type":39,"key":143,"url":144},"62816a52-9383-4b92-87d0-3b2cd50603a5","\u002Ffind-a-parcelshop?lockers=true#\u002F",{"link_type":43},{"Title":147,"Description":151,"Image":155,"Label":30,"UrlText":37,"Url":161,"buttonDataGtmTrack":30,"SecondaryButtonText":30,"SecondaryButtonUrl":163,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":30,"ShowAppDownloadCta":30},[148],{"type":107,"text":149,"spans":150},"Courier collection",[],[152],{"type":34,"text":153,"spans":154},"Book a parcel collection from your home or work. You’ll need to print the label.",[],{"dimensions":156,"alt":157,"copyright":30,"url":158,"id":159,"edit":160},{"width":79,"height":80},"Following a doorstep collection in a block of flats, an Evri Courier is handing the customer a blue slip containing the details of the collection.","how-to-return-a-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6pDmZbqstJ9-cfc_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4215.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6pDmZbqstJ9-cfc",{"x":52,"y":52,"zoom":53,"background":85},{"link_type":39,"key":162,"url":41},"f062bbc3-57e7-44e3-8fbf-72ff60b181e3",{"link_type":43},{"SectionTitle":165,"SectionDescription":170,"theme":30},[166],{"type":167,"text":168,"spans":169},"heading2","2. Choose your return method",[],[171],{"type":34,"text":172,"spans":173},"All we need is your order reference number, email address, reason for returning the parcel and, for some retailers, what it is you’ll be returning. Take your pick from:",[],"article_link_module$8310c201-7bdc-4224-b8b9-aed0bd2f8170","article_link_module",{"variation":25,"version":26,"items":177,"primary":179,"id":212,"slice_type":72,"slice_label":30},[178],{},{"CardImage":180,"CardAvatar":64,"CardTitle":187,"CardText":188,"ButtonText":37,"ButtonUrl":210,"IsEco":21},{"dimensions":181,"alt":182,"copyright":30,"url":183,"id":184,"edit":185},{"width":79,"height":80},"ParcelShop store assistant is smiling and using a blue hand-held device to scan a parcel. The customer can be seen in the foreground.","how-to-return-a-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJDpbqstJ9-Tfl_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2668.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=47%2C0%2C5906%2C3939&w=1000&h=667","Z6TJDpbqstJ9-Tfl",{"x":186,"y":52,"zoom":53,"background":85},47,"3. Drop off your parcel or let your courier collect it",[189],{"type":34,"text":190,"spans":191},"If you choose to return your parcel using a ParcelShop, you can either print the Evri returns label at home or in a ParcelShop with Print In ParcelShop device using a QR or authorisation code (we’ll email it to you).\nFor our Lockers – open 24\u002F7 – just print and attach the label, then drop off your parcel whenever it suits you.\nIf you’ve arranged a courier collection, we’ll let you know when we’ll be collecting it.",[192,195,198,201,204,207],{"start":193,"end":194,"type":94},44,54,{"start":193,"end":194,"type":96,"data":196},{"link_type":39,"url":197},"how-to-return-a-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fparcelshops",{"start":199,"end":200,"type":94},116,151,{"start":199,"end":200,"type":96,"data":202},{"link_type":39,"url":203},"how-to-return-a-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fparcelshops\u002Fprint-in-parcelshop",{"start":205,"end":206,"type":94},225,244,{"start":205,"end":206,"type":96,"data":208},{"link_type":39,"url":209},"how-to-return-a-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fparcelshops\u002Flockers",{"link_type":39,"key":211,"url":41},"10c9ca2a-f8a4-4fc2-9451-862b5a097eb2","card$8d19737a-9cf1-4a03-8e91-fccccdec2c88",{"variation":25,"version":26,"items":214,"primary":216,"id":239,"slice_type":240,"slice_label":30},[215],{},{"title":217,"bodyText":218,"isEco":21,"PaddingTop":21,"PaddingBottom":21,"NoMarginBottom":21,"hasButton":228,"buttonText":229,"buttonLink":230,"image":233},"Return your parcel using a Print In ParcelShop device",[219,222,225],{"type":34,"text":220,"spans":221},"If your return is free, you can take your item to any ParcelShop with a Print In ParcelShop device without booking online first.",[],{"type":34,"text":223,"spans":224},"Simply select your retailer, enter your return information, print your label and hand the parcel to a member of store staff.",[],{"type":34,"text":226,"spans":227},"If you need to pay for your return, just fill in your details online first and use the QR or authorisation code we’ll email to you at the Print In ParcelShop device to print off your label.",[],true,"More information",{"link_type":39,"key":231,"url":232},"2954146d-5ad8-43fb-be92-c4e740a94847","\u002Fparcelshops\u002Fprint-in-parcelshop",{"dimensions":234,"alt":235,"copyright":30,"url":236,"id":237,"edit":238},{"width":79,"height":80},"A close-up of a customer applying a label to their parcel. A ParcelShop Print in Store device is in view behind the parcel.","how-to-return-a-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJbpbqstJ9-TgK_EVRI_LOCATION_PIS2.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C0%2C6706%2C4473&w=1000&h=667","Z6TJbpbqstJ9-TgK",{"x":52,"y":52,"zoom":53,"background":85},"feature_banner$8d9324d7-8660-43c8-b975-5ad3c94ffb1b","feature_banner",{"variation":25,"version":26,"items":242,"primary":283,"id":286,"slice_type":175,"slice_label":30},[243,263],{"Title":244,"Description":248,"Image":252,"Label":30,"UrlText":259,"Url":260,"buttonDataGtmTrack":30,"SecondaryButtonText":30,"SecondaryButtonUrl":262,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":30,"ShowAppDownloadCta":30},[245],{"type":107,"text":246,"spans":247},"Find your local ParcelShop or Locker",[],[249],{"type":34,"text":250,"spans":251},"Enter your postcode to find your nearest ParcelShop or Locker",[],{"dimensions":253,"alt":254,"copyright":30,"url":255,"id":256,"edit":257},{"width":79,"height":80},"An Evri ParcelShop is in full view with its blue signage and a customer is walking up the accesssbility ramp and holding a parcel.","how-to-return-a-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJWZbqstJ9-Tf__EVRI_LOCATION_03_3111.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=470%2C0%2C5460%2C3642&w=1000&h=667","Z6TJWZbqstJ9-Tf_",{"x":258,"y":52,"zoom":53,"background":85},470,"Find a ParcelShop or Locker",{"link_type":39,"key":261,"url":124},"0e085df7-7639-4738-b4ed-bd0a6df3d18b",{"link_type":43},{"Title":264,"Description":268,"Image":272,"Label":30,"UrlText":278,"Url":279,"buttonDataGtmTrack":30,"SecondaryButtonText":30,"SecondaryButtonUrl":282,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":30,"ShowAppDownloadCta":30},[265],{"type":107,"text":266,"spans":267},"Track your return parcel",[],[269],{"type":34,"text":270,"spans":271},"Track your parcel throughout its journey",[],{"dimensions":273,"alt":274,"copyright":30,"url":275,"id":276,"edit":277},{"width":79,"height":80},"A close-up of a customer sitting on a sofa, holding their phone and looking at the screen. The display shows the 'Track' page for the customer to track where their parcel is on its journey.","how-to-return-a-parcel.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6XtIZbqstJ9-Wfd_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5633.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6XtIZbqstJ9-Wfd",{"x":52,"y":52,"zoom":53,"background":85},"Track your parcel",{"link_type":39,"key":280,"url":281},"46955bbc-f2c1-4dda-b2f4-74ec1c6e022b","\u002Ftrack-a-parcel",{"link_type":43},{"SectionTitle":284,"SectionDescription":285,"theme":30},[],[],"article_link_module$66f1ff47-c523-4616-8f7a-1efe8be35ce6",{"variation":288,"version":26,"items":289,"primary":355,"id":360,"slice_type":361,"slice_label":30},"default",[290,296,302,308,314,326,339,345],{"rowTitle":291,"rowBody":292,"rowDataGtmTrack":30},"I can't find my retailers name on the list, what should I do?",[293],{"type":34,"text":294,"spans":295},"Unfortunately, we don’t offer a returns service for all retailers, so if your retailer’s name isn’t showing they might not use Evri for their returns. If you can’t find your retailer, we’d recommend contacting them to find out if they use Evri for their returns, as well as what name you’ll find them under.",[],{"rowTitle":297,"rowBody":298,"rowDataGtmTrack":30},"Can I send a parcel back to a retailer you don't return for?",[299],{"type":34,"text":300,"spans":301},"If your retailer’s name isn’t on our list and we don’t return for them, please contact them directly to see what returns methods they use. We'd also recommend checking inside the package, as some retailers leave an insert with details on returning the item to them.",[],{"rowTitle":303,"rowBody":304,"rowDataGtmTrack":30},"Can I return an item with Evri?",[305],{"type":34,"text":306,"spans":307},"Yes, provided the retailer or seller uses Evri for their returns. First, check to see how the retailer or seller would like you to return your item. This could be a pre-printed label that came with your parcel, or your retailer might book it with us for you. Or, you can use our app or website to return it yourself.",[],{"rowTitle":309,"rowBody":310,"rowDataGtmTrack":30},"How long will my return take to get back to the retailer?",[311],{"type":34,"text":312,"spans":313},"Please allow 14 days from the time you returned your item. It can sometimes take a while for the retailer or seller to confirm they’ve received your parcel.",[],{"rowTitle":315,"rowBody":316,"rowDataGtmTrack":30},"What if my return hasn’t been received?",[317],{"type":34,"text":318,"spans":319},"If 14 days have passed since you sent your item back, and your retailer says that they haven’t received it, please let your retailer know so they can investigate. If you’ve paid postage for your return, then please contact our customer services team at ReturnsSupport@evri.com – they’ll investigate it for you.",[320,323],{"start":321,"end":322,"type":94},253,276,{"start":321,"end":322,"type":96,"data":324},{"link_type":39,"url":325},"mailto:returnssupport@evri.com",{"rowTitle":327,"rowBody":328,"rowDataGtmTrack":30},"How should I package my parcel?",[329],{"type":34,"text":330,"spans":331,"direction":114},"Have a look at our guide on how to wrap your parcel to make sure that your parcel arrives back safely.",[332,338],{"start":333,"end":334,"type":96,"data":335},28,51,{"link_type":39,"url":336,"target":337},"\u002Fsend\u002Fhow-to-wrap-a-parcel","_blank",{"start":333,"end":334,"type":94},{"rowTitle":340,"rowBody":341,"rowDataGtmTrack":30},"How will I know the retailer has received my return?",[342],{"type":34,"text":343,"spans":344},"When your parcel is on its way back to the retailer, you’ll see the message ‘On its way back to the retailer’ as your final tracking point. From this point, you’ll know that we’ve handed your parcel back to your retailer, they’ll notify you either when they receive the parcel, or when the refund is complete. ",[],{"rowTitle":346,"rowBody":347,"rowDataGtmTrack":30},"How much does a return cost?",[348],{"type":34,"text":349,"spans":350,"direction":114},"Costs vary for different sellers and retailers, and some offer free returns with us. We recommend contacting the retailer directly if you have any questions about costs, or look on their app or website by searching for the returns section. You can also book your return with us, and you’ll be given a price once you’ve provided us with the details about your parcel.",[351,354],{"start":321,"end":352,"type":96,"data":353},277,{"link_type":39,"url":41,"target":337},{"start":321,"end":352,"type":94},{"title":356,"titleSize":357,"subtitle":30,"backgroundColor":358,"hasButton":21,"buttonText":30,"buttonLink":359,"buttonDataGtmTrack":30},"FAQs","h4","brand-03",{"link_type":43},"accordion$0de72341-b464-4fb7-95aa-30f551f1d123","accordion",["Reactive",363],{"$sglobal-feature-switches":364,"$sclients":43